<newsitem itemid="783360" id="root" date="1997-08-06" xml:lang="en">
<title>UK: TABLE- Woolwich ups H1 pretax profit.</title>
<headline>TABLE- Woolwich ups H1 pretax profit.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half to June 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Basic shr (pence)	7.1		    vs 7.5</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 3.0		    vs n/a</p>
<p> Headline pretax profit 214.5		  vs 189.5</p>
<p> Pretax profit	    187.8		  vs 183.1</p>
<p> Exceptional costs	26.7		   vs 6.4</p>
<p> Operating income	 395.4		  vs 388.8</p>
<p> Provision bad debt     7.2		    vs 22.9</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 180 and 185 million stg. The headline pre-tax profit did not include the exceptional operating costs of the bank's conversion from a building society and flotation on the stock exchange on July 7.</p>
<p>Full company name - Woolwich Plc</p>
</text>
